OL,3,GNEWSARenewed appeal in murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation one year on
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have renewed an appeal for
OL,7,Finformation one year after a man was
OL,8,Ffound dead in woodland.
OL,10,FThe body of Ernest Konrad Deputat, 45,
OL,11,Fwas discovered by a member of the
OL,12,Fpublic in woodland on Southampton
OL,13,FCommon, close to a wildlife reserve
OL,14,Fnorth of the Ornamental Lake on 8
OL,15,FOctober, 2025.
OL,17,FTwo men, aged 30 and 34, were
OL,18,Fsubsequently arrested on suspicion of
OL,19,Fmurder and were released on conditional
OL,20,Fpolice bail.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
